# Duka Mkononi Website Cursor Rule

Static HTML marketing site (English + Swahili) for Duka Mkononi.

## Required workflow before finishing
1. Run `git status` and `git diff`; confirm only intentional files changed
2. If shared marketing/legal content changed, update both language variants (`*-en.html` and Swahili counterparts)
3. Update `README.md` when page set or deploy flow changes
4. If conventions drift, update `.cursor/` in the same change set

## Conventions
- Keep EN/SW content paired
- Do not invent product limits that contradict the mobile app
- Prefer small, reviewable page edits
